<title>USA: North Bancshares to buy back 100,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>North Bancshares to buy back 100,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Bancshares Inc, holding company for North Federal Savings Bank, said Tuesday it intends to repurchase 100,000 shares, or about 9.5 percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>It said the buyback, in open market or privately negotiated transactions over a one-year period, would be its seventh such program.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
